    <string name="floating_hub_icon_legend_title">Icons on the floating bar</string>
    <string name="floating_hub_icon_legend_body">Left arrow — System back (short tap); long press on left arrow while menu open — close menu
Box — Pick target app for map projection
Map — Open cluster screen (project)
X — Stop projection
Lightning — Show / expand quick actions menu
Double left arrow — Collapse quick actions
Phone — Foreground apps on display 1
Monitor — Foreground apps on display 2</string>
